<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Application Update</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff;">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div style="background-color: #374151; padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center;">
            {{#if companyLogo}}
            <img src="{{companyLogo}}" alt="{{organizationName}}" style="max-height: 50px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            {{/if}}
            <h1 style="color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500;">Thank you for your interest</h1>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div style="padding: 40px 30px;">
            <h2 style="color: #374151; margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500;">
                Dear {{candidateName}},
            </h2>
            
            <p style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;">
                Thank you for taking the time to apply for the <strong>{{jobTitle}}</strong> position at {{organizationName}}. We appreciate your interest in joining our team and the effort you put into your application.
            </p>
            
            <div style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0; border-left: 4px solid #6b7280;">
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #374151; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
                    After careful consideration and review of all applications, we have decided to move forward with candidates whose qualifications more closely align with our current specific requirements for this role.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            {{#if feedback}}
            <div style="background-color: #fef3c7; border: 1px solid #f59e0b; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0;">
                <h4 style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #92400e; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;">
                    Feedback from our team:
                </h4>
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #92400e; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
                    {{feedback}}
                </p>
            </div>
            {{/if}}
            
            <p style="margin: 25px 0; color: #374151; font-size: 16px;">
                Please know that this decision is not a reflection of your professional qualifications or potential. The selection process is highly competitive, and we often have to make difficult choices among many talented candidates.
            </p>
            
            <div style="background-color: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #3b82f6; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0;">
                <h4 style="margin: 0 0 15px; color: #1e40af; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;">
                    We encourage you to:
                </h4>
                <ul style="margin: 0; color: #1e3a8a; font-size: 15px; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Continue monitoring our careers page for future opportunities</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Apply for other positions that match your skills and interests</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Connect with us on LinkedIn to stay updated on company news</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Consider us for future career opportunities</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <p style="margin: 25px 0; color: #374151; font-size: 16px;">
                Your experience and qualifications are valuable, and we believe you'll find the right opportunity that's a perfect fit for your career goals.
            </p>
            
            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic;">
                    We wish you continued success in your career journey.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Footer -->
        <div style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #374151; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px;">
                Sincerely,
            </p>
            <p style="margin: 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 15px;">
                {{organizationName}} Hiring Team
            </p>
            
            <div style="margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;">
                    This email was sent regarding your application for {{jobTitle}}.<br>
                    Please do not reply to this email. For questions about future opportunities, visit our careers page.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
